 "description": "<p>Framed and built as a massager, and the framing holds: nine kneading-and-rubbing modes do the deep-work imitation — the rolling pressure a pair of thumbs would apply — while nine vibration modes run the surface layer. Used on shoulders, neck or anywhere tension parks itself, the two banks combine into something recognizably massage-shaped.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_2_6ebc6edf-598b-4c4c-ae0b-d39814f8f3fb_480x480.jpg?v=1692951196\"></p>\n<p>Waterproof construction takes the routine into the bath or shower, which is where much of real massage happens anyway, and the waterproofing doubles as easy-wash hygiene after body-oil sessions.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_1_20009bc8-738b-4bc5-8ef0-b18b2918acad_480x480.jpg?v=1692951193\"></p>\n<p>USB magnetic charging keeps the cable question simple, and the ergonomic body carries a grip that survives full-pressure use without wrist strain. Dual-purpose by design: a credible massager that also knows its other job.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_3_8813040f-427f-4ca2-88ba-0d7060f201ba_480x480.jpg?v=1692951199\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Kneading modes: 9 (deep-work imitation)</li>\n<li>Vibration modes: 9</li>\n<li>Body: ergonomic grip</li>\n<li>Charging: USB magnetic</li>\n<li>Waterproof: yes</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_4_104df2e3-a7e2-4405-9ed9-6d28d229b54f_480x480.jpg?v=1692951202\"><br />\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_5_f48c2748-674e-4a75-b5f5-067f5095d07b_480x480.jpg?v=1692951205\" alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<p>Both channels run from one button sequence, so switching mid-massage costs nothing. Eighteen modes of thumb-and-buzz — the massager that earns shelf space on both counts.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Rose kneading massager with 9 rubbing modes and 9 vibration modes, waterproof body and USB magnetic charging for bath-side use.</p>\n",
